        <text>Nevermind.</text>
        <event load="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_LOAD" />
    </choice>
</event>
<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_OE_GREASE_EFFECT_SHOCK">
	<text>You have tech on your ship which can be scanned by your Weapons Amplifier.
[Shock Enhancement: Causes the last projectile in the volley to break and stun all doors in the room.]
It will take a while to scan, giving the fleet time to catch up. Proceed?</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Proceed.</text>
		<event>
			<text>Your system scans the technology, adding the enhancement to the system's library.</text>
			<modifyPursuit amount="1"/>
			<hiddenAug>OE_GREASE_EFFECT_SHOCK</hiddenAug>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_LOAD"/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_LOAD" />
	</choice>
</event>
<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_OE_GREASE_EFFECT_SHATTER">
	<text>You have tech on your ship which can be scanned by your Weapons Amplifier.
[Shatter Enhancement: Causes the last projectile in the volley to create an extremely weak lockdown, the next hit to this room while the lockdown is active will do 2x damage.]
It will take a while to scan, giving the fleet time to catch up. Proceed?</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Proceed.</text>
		<event>
			<text>Your system scans the technology, adding the enhancement to the system's library.</text>
			<modifyPursuit amount="1"/>
			<hiddenAug>OE_GREASE_EFFECT_SHATTER</hiddenAug>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
				<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_LOAD"/>
			</choice>
		</event>
	</choice>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Nevermind</text>
		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_LOAD" />
	</choice>
</event>
<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_OE_GREASE_EFFECT_ACID">
	<text>You have tech on your ship which can be scanned by your Weapons Amplifier.
[Acidic Enhancement: Causes the last projectile in the volley to create acidic that erodes the system on hit.]
