		<event load="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_LOAD" />
	</choice>
</event>
<event name="STORAGE_CHECK_SYSTEM_OE_GREASE_EFFECT_CHAOS">
	<text>You have tech on your ship which can be scanned by your Weapons Amplifier.
[Chaos Enhancement: Causes the last projectile in the volley to trigger a random effect that you have available.]
It will take a while to scan, giving the fleet time to catch up. Proceed?</text>
	<choice hidden="true">
		<text>Proceed.</text>
		<event>
			<text>Your system scans the technology, adding the enhancement to the system's library.</text>
			<modifyPursuit amount="1"/>
			<hiddenAug>OE_GREASE_EFFECT_CHAOS</hiddenAug>
			<choice hidden="true">
				<text>Continue...</text>
